  "description": [
    "285 pages : 26 cm",
    "\"She jian shang de Zhongguo (di 2 ji) \" tu shu yong jing cai de tu wen wan zheng zhan xian tong ming ji lu pian de nei zai qi zhi he wen hua jing sui, fen bie cong shi jie, jiao bu, xin chuan, jia chang, mi jing, xiang feng, san can ji bu fen tan tao Zhongguo ren yu shi wu de guan xi. Zhongguo ren yong zhi hui qiao miao di cong zi ran jie huo qu mei wei, zhe yi qie zhi suo yi neng gou shi xian, du de yi yu ta men dui shang tian he shi wu de jing wei yi ji dui zi ji shen ai de na pian tu di de juan lian. Cong yi ri san can kan dao ren sheng de wu wei za chen, cong yi zhou yi fan pin chu ping shi zhi pu de chu shi zhi dao. Yong jing mei di tu pian ji wen zi chu dong du zhe si xiang zhi qing, gan shou Zhongguo ren yong shi wu chuan di chu xiang ju bie li de shen qing, yi ji dui gu tu de juan lian"
  ],
